meta-df-common
==============

Machine-agnostic part of the DontFall custom layer (meta-df).

Everything that is shared between all supported machines belongs here:
custom distribution configuration, common recipes and image features.

Contents:

  conf/templates/default/          bblayers.conf/local.conf template
                                   used by oe-init-build-env
  recipes-core/images/df-image-minimal.bb
                                   minimal DontFall image target

Machine-specific support lives in the sibling layers
(e.g. meta-df-stm32mp157c-dk2).
